Your subject line is the first thing that the hotel manager will see in their inbox. Make it attention-grabbing and informative, giving the hotel manager a glimpse of what they can expect from your email. Keep it concise and to the point.
4. Begin with a strong introduction
Introduce yourself briefly and explain why you are reaching out to the hotel. Mention your passion for travel and content creation, and emphasize how working with the hotel aligns with your values and goals.
